5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To ensure our choice is sustainable, I believe we should look beyond the glossy brochures and examine the actual longevity of previous works.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. I am concerned about the actual feasibility of the timelines and the capacity of the local contractors to deliver on schedule.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to be here! I really want to make sure we don't pick something that looks pretty now but becomes a money pit later!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to be realistic about the operational side. A plan is only as good as the people available to maintain it daily.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Asuka. We must ensure the plan aligns with the physical reality of the site and the actual patterns of use.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Quite right. I shall investigate the historical performance of our city's projects to see if they actually age as gracefully as the architects claim.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will focus on the logistics. I want to see who is actually bidding for the earth-moving and how the site hoarding is being phased.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'm going to check the spending! I want to see how much we've been spending per hectare and who is actually doing the groundskeeping.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups. I want to know who is actually on the ground.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will examine the drainage callouts and the weekday crossing counts. We need to know how the land and the people behave.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent approach from everyone. I suspect the ""Condition of works from the earlier programme"" will be quite illuminating.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I believe that is a wise choice.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm just worried about the bills! @Benjamin, do you think the old projects were too expensive to keep up?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Cost is one thing, but manpower is another. If the staff is stretched too thin, the budget doesn't matter.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,Exactly. A plan that ignores the physical strain on the land or the flow of pedestrians is destined to fail.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. I shall also look into the record of the eastern avenue planting to see if the greenery actually survived the decade.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
